{"seq":2,"slug":"envoy-thread-model-connection-lifecycle","title":"线程模型与连接生命周期：worker 池、accept 分发与连接池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/envoy-architecture-data-plane/envoy-thread-model-connection-lifecycle","wordCount":2303,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程模型与连接生命周期-worker-池-accept-分发与连接池\">线程模型与连接生命周期：worker 池、accept 分发与连接池</h1><p>某个跨境电商站的大促零点，网关 Pod 的 CPU 只用了 40%，P99 却从 80ms 跳到 2.3s。定位发现不是后端慢，而是 Envoy 只给了 <code>--concurrency 1</code>，单个 worker 被一条慢上游拖住，accept 队列排到了几百个连接。根因几乎总在同一处：把 Envoy 当成&quot;一个进程处理所有请求&quot;的黑盒，而它实际是&quot;一个主线程 + N 个 worker 线程，各自 accept、各自持有连接、各自维护连接池&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-主线程-worker-线程与三条不共享的路径\">核心概念：主线程、worker 线程与三条不共享的路径</h2><p>Envoy 的官方描述是 &quot;single process, multiple threads&quot;，架构上 &quot;highly concurrent and non-blocking&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/intro/threading_model\">Envoy threading model</a>）。它不是&quot;没有阻塞&quot;，而是&quot;阻塞被赶到别处&quot;：异步文件 IO、缓存淘汰、地理库重载、阻塞式 <code>getaddrinfo</code> 解析都移到 helper 线程。三条路径各管一段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>线程</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>是否碰数据面流量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主线程 main</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>xDS 配置下发、stats flush、admin、进程信号</td>\n<td>否（&quot;does not handle high-volume traffic directly&quot;）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>worker</td>\n<td><code>--concurrency</code></td>\n<td>监听、过滤、转发</td>\n<td>是，连接整个生命周期都在某一个 worker 上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>file flusher</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>把 access log 落盘</td>\n<td>否，避免日志阻塞请求处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  CP[&quot;xDS 控制面&lt;br/&gt;LDS / CDS / RDS / EDS&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;配置更新&quot;| Main[&quot;主线程 main&lt;br/&gt;+ file flusher&quot;]&#10;  Main --&gt;|&quot;post closure 更新 TLS&quot;| W1[&quot;worker 1&quot;]&#10;  Main --&gt;|&quot;post closure 更新 TLS&quot;| WN[&quot;worker N&quot;]&#10;  W1 --&gt; C1[&quot;连接绑定 worker 1&lt;br/&gt;全生命周期&quot;]&#10;  WN --&gt; C2[&quot;连接绑定 worker N&lt;br/&gt;全生命周期&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; P1[&quot;该 worker 私有连接池&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; P2[&quot;该 worker 私有连接池&quot;]\">graph TD\n  CP[\"xDS 控制面&lt;br/&gt;LDS / CDS / RDS / EDS\"] --&gt;|\"配置更新\"| Main[\"主线程 main&lt;br/&gt;+ file flusher\"]\n  Main --&gt;|\"post closure 更新 TLS\"| W1[\"worker 1\"]\n  Main --&gt;|\"post closure 更新 TLS\"| WN[\"worker N\"]\n  W1 --&gt; C1[\"连接绑定 worker 1&lt;br/&gt;全生命周期\"]\n  WN --&gt; C2[\"连接绑定 worker N&lt;br/&gt;全生命周期\"]\n  C1 --&gt; P1[\"该 worker 私有连接池\"]\n  C2 --&gt; P2[\"该 worker 私有连接池\"]</pre><p>主线程与 worker 之间只通过 <strong>Thread Local Storage（TLS）</strong> 传配置：主线程分配一个 TLS slot，更新时向每个 worker post 一个 closure，worker 在自己的线程里<strong>重建一份数据副本</strong>，之后数据面热路径通过 O(1) 的 vector 查表访问，cluster manager 与 stats store 因此保持 lock-free。关键推论：<strong>一条连接一旦被某个 worker accept，就绑定它一辈子</strong>（&quot;bound to a single worker thread for its entire lifetime&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"worker-池规模与-accept-分发\">worker 池规模与 accept 分发</h2><p>worker 数量由 <code>--concurrency</code> 决定，官方建议对多数负载取&quot;一个硬件线程配一个 worker&quot;。但在容器里这个建议会反噬：Pod 的 CPU limit 是 2 核、节点却有 64 个物理线程时，Envoy 若按节点核数起 64 个 worker，会在 2 核配额上疯狂上下文切换；应显式设 <code>--concurrency</code> 等于 CPU limit 的整数部分。</p>\n<p>accept 的默认行为最容易被误解：<strong>worker 之间没有任何协调</strong>，每个 worker 都尝试在每个 listener 上 accept，由内核决定把新连接给谁。内核能做这件事靠的是每个 worker 各持有一个 listener socket，即 <code>SO_REUSEPORT</code>——<code>enable_reuse_port</code> 的文档默认值就是 <code>true</code>（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/listener/v3/listener.proto\">listener.proto</a>）。于是内核的 4 元组哈希决定连到哪个 worker，<strong>单条 HTTP/2 长连接的全部流量会只落在一个 worker 上</strong>。连接数少而每条都长寿（HTTP/2、gRPC mesh egress 是典型）时这种偏斜很显著；此时按 listener 配置 <code>connection_balance_config</code>，它要求以下三者<strong>恰好选一个</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>分发依据</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不配置（默认）</td>\n<td>内核 SO_REUSEPORT 哈希</td>\n<td>短连接多、连接数远大于 worker 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exact_balance</code></td>\n<td>Envoy 内部计数器，精确均摊</td>\n<td>少量长寿 HTTP/2 连接（gRPC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extend_balance</code></td>\n<td>自定义 <code>type_url</code> 指定 balancer</td>\n<td>特殊策略实验（非法 type_url 退化为不分发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu_locality_balance</code></td>\n<td>内核 BPF 按 CPU locality 定向</td>\n<td>追求 NUMA 与缓存局部性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Windows 上 Envoy <strong>强制</strong>启用 listener balancing，因为 Windows 内核与其异步 IO 模型不会正确分发连接。accept 侧另有 <code>max_connections_to_accept_per_socket_event</code>（不填则一次取完所有 pending）与 <code>tcp_backlog_size</code>（Linux 不填取 <code>net.core.somaxconn</code>，其它平台 128）；backlog 太小会在突刺时丢连接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接生命周期-从-accept-到优雅关闭\">连接生命周期：从 accept 到优雅关闭</h2><p>一条新连接进入 Envoy 后的处理次序是固定的：listener 上先跑 <strong>listener filters</strong>（在 filter chain 之前执行，可改写连接元数据），然后按 <code>filter_chain_match</code> 选出唯一一条 <strong>filter chain</strong>，该 chain 才实例化自己的 L3/L4 过滤器栈（通常是 HTTP Connection Manager，HCM）（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/listeners/listeners\">listeners overview</a>）。listener filters 超时默认 <strong>15s</strong>，超时后是否仍建连由 <code>continue_on_listener_filters_timeout</code> 决定（默认 <strong>false</strong>）；无 chain 匹配且未配 <code>default_filter_chain</code> 时连接被直接关闭。</p>\n<p>HCM 拿到连接后，用一组定时器定义它活多久、何时回收（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/extensions/filters/network/http_connection_manager/v3/http_connection_manager.proto\">http_connection_manager.proto</a>、<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/core/v3/protocol.proto\">protocol.proto</a>）：| 字段 | 默认值 | 语义 |\n|------|-------|------|\n| <code>stream_idle_timeout</code> | 5 分钟（0 禁用） | 单条 stream 空闲计时；响应头前超时返回 408，之后 reset |\n| <code>request_timeout</code> | 禁用（不填或 0） | 收完整个请求的时间上限；<strong>不适合流式请求</strong> |\n| <code>idle_timeout</code> | 1 小时（0 禁用） | 下游连接空闲多久后关闭 |\n| <code>max_connection_duration</code> | 无上限 | 连接最长存活时间，到点触发 draining |\n| <code>max_requests_per_connection</code> | 无上限 | 单连接最多处理多少请求 |\n| <code>drain_timeout</code> | 5000 ms | draining 时首个 GOAWAY 到最终 GOAWAY 的宽限期 |\n| <code>delayed_close_timeout</code> | 1000 ms | 等对端先关 socket 的宽限，超时才强制关 |</p>\n<p><code>drain_timeout</code> 的语义值得算一遍。设某 worker 上有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 条活跃 HTTP/2 连接、每条承载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 条在途 stream，draining 时 Envoy 先发 GOAWAY 通知对端&quot;别再开新 stream&quot;，再等旧 stream 排空：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{drain} \\approx \\max\\left(t_{grace},\\ \\frac{S \\cdot \\bar{r}}{C}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单条 stream 平均剩余处理时间。若配置了 <code>drain_timeout_jitter</code>，实际宽限被随机拉长以<strong>打散</strong>多个连接同时关闭的尖峰——没有 jitter 的滚动发布里，所有 Pod 会在同一秒同时切断客户端连接。上游侧相反：Envoy 会尽力<strong>延长</strong>连接寿命以减少握手成本，一个健康的上游 host 通常只需<strong>一条</strong>连接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接池-每个-worker-每个-host-每种协议各一套\">连接池：每个 worker、每个 host、每种协议各一套</h2><p>连接池的粒度最需要记牢：<strong>每个 worker 线程为每个 cluster 维护自己独立的一套连接池</strong>（&quot;Each worker thread maintains its own connection pools for each cluster&quot;）（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/connection_pooling\">connection pooling</a>）。它不是共享池，而是&quot;worker 数 × cluster 数 × host 数 × 协议数&quot;的乘积累加；路由优先级、socket 选项、transport socket 与 TLS 选项，甚至 <code>hashable</code> filter-state 对象不同，都会各自分开。官方例子：2 个 worker 加 HTTP/1.1 与 HTTP/2 并用，仅协议维度就至少 4 个池。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{pools} \\ge W \\times \\sum_{c} H_c \\times P_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是 worker 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 cluster <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的 host 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该 cluster 的协议数。跨境场景里这个乘法的代价很真实：20 个 worker、跨 3 个 region 的 200 个 host，若每个 worker 都为每个 host 保留一条 HTTP/1.1 保活连接，峰值可能压出上万个上游连接。三种协议的上游池差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>复用方式</th>\n<th>何时排空</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>一连接一请求，<strong>禁用 pipelining</strong></td>\n<td>上游关闭时只 reset 单个下游请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n<td>多路复用，受 <code>max_concurrent_streams</code> 与 <code>max_requests_per_connection</code> 约束</td>\n<td>收到 GOAWAY 或达到 <code>max_requests_per_connection</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/3</td>\n<td>同 HTTP/2 模型，受 QUIC/H3 同名字段约束</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HTTP/1.1 刻意不用 pipelining 的理由写在文档里：一旦上游连接断开，只需 reset <strong>一个</strong>下游请求，而不是把一整串已发出未收到响应的请求全部作废。对支付回调这类不可重复执行的接口，这个设计把影响面压到最小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断阈值与连接池的相互作用\">熔断阈值与连接池的相互作用</h2><p>连接池不会无限增长，兜底的是熔断（circuit breaking），它按 cluster 维度、跨所有 worker 统计（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/circuit_breaking\">circuit_breaking</a>、<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto\">circuit_breaker.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>溢出统计</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>max_connections</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_cx_overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_pending_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_pending_overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_active_overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_retries</code></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_retry_overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_connection_pools</code></td>\n<td>无上限</td>\n<td><code>upstream_cx_pool_overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个细节决定这些数字在生产里的含义。<strong>第一</strong>，统计&quot;最终一致&quot;：阈值跨 worker 共享但计数存在竞态，瞬时超限是允许的。<strong>第二</strong>，即使 <code>max_connections</code> 已打开，Envoy 仍保证每个被负载均衡选中的 host <strong>至少分配到一条</strong>连接，实际连接数可超过上限，上界是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>max_connections</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{max\\_connections} + H \\times N_{pools}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_connections</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>第三</strong>，<code>max_connection_pools</code> 限制的是<strong>池实例数</strong>而非连接数，池不会自动超时回收，该值一般不应大于 <code>max_connections</code>。重试侧官方更推荐 <code>retry_budget</code>（<code>budget_percent</code> 默认 20%）而非静态 <code>max_retries</code>，以切断重试风暴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商链路上的调优取舍\">跨境电商链路上的调优取舍</h2><p><strong>worker 数与池放大。</strong> worker 数直接乘进连接池规模：若上游是跨境 SaaS（支付网关、物流查询 API），把 worker 从 8 提到 32，上游连接数下限也翻 4 倍。应先按 CPU limit 定 worker，再用 <code>max_connections</code> 与 <code>max_connection_pools</code> 反向约束。</p>\n<p><strong>长连接偏斜。</strong> 若某条 HTTP/2 连接承载了某个大卖家的全部请求，内核哈希会把它钉在一个 worker 上，这类 listener 应显式配 <code>exact_balance</code>；短连接为主的公网入口保持默认更快。</p>\n<p><strong>drain 与滚动发布。</strong> 跨境发布常跨多 region，drain 窗口太短会切断在途订单请求。把 <code>drain_timeout</code> 与后端最慢接口的尾延迟对齐，并开启 <code>drain_timeout_jitter</code> 打散关闭时刻，能压平发布期 P99 毛刺。反之 <code>stream_idle_timeout</code> 默认 5 分钟对流式接口（如物流轨迹推送）可能过短，需放宽或禁用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Envoy 是&quot;单进程多线程&quot;：1 个主线程管配置、stats 与 admin，N 个 worker 跑数据面，1 个 file flusher 专管日志落盘；主线程不碰大流量。</li>\n<li>连接一旦被某个 worker accept 就<strong>终身绑定</strong>该 worker；默认靠内核 <code>SO_REUSEPORT</code> 分发，<code>enable_reuse_port</code> 默认 true。</li>\n<li>少量长寿连接（HTTP/2、gRPC）要用 <code>connection_balance_config</code> 里的 <code>exact_balance</code> 纠正偏斜；Windows 强制启用 balancing。</li>\n<li>连接生命周期由一组定时器定义：<code>stream_idle_timeout</code> 5 分钟、<code>request_timeout</code> 禁用、<code>idle_timeout</code> 1 小时、<code>drain_timeout</code> 5000ms、<code>delayed_close_timeout</code> 1000ms。</li>\n<li>连接池是 per-worker、per-host、per-protocol 的乘积，还会因优先级、socket 选项、TLS 选项继续分裂——排查&quot;上游连接数暴涨&quot;时先算这个乘法。</li>\n<li>熔断默认 <code>max_connections</code>/<code>max_pending_requests</code>/<code>max_requests</code> 各 1024、<code>max_retries</code> 3；计数最终一致，实际连接可超上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章其余文档补齐这条链路的另外几段：<a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程模型与连接生命周期：worker 池、accept 分发与连接池","id":"线程模型与连接生命周期-worker-池-accept-分发与连接池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：主线程、worker 线程与三条不共享的路径","id":"核心概念-主线程-worker-线程与三条不共享的路径"},{"level":2,"text":"worker 池规模与 accept 分发","id":"worker-池规模与-accept-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"连接生命周期：从 accept 到优雅关闭","id":"连接生命周期-从-accept-到优雅关闭"},{"level":2,"text":"连接池：每个 worker、每个 host、每种协议各一套","id":"连接池-每个-worker-每个-host-每种协议各一套"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断阈值与连接池的相互作用","id":"熔断阈值与连接池的相互作用"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商链路上的调优取舍","id":"跨境电商链路上的调优取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Envoy 数据面架构与四层资源模型（Listener/Cluster/Route/Endpoint）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/envoy-architecture-data-plane/envoy-data-plane-resource-model"},"next":{"title":"配置热重载与数据面诊断：Admin 接口、config dump 与排障实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/envoy-architecture-data-plane/envoy-hot-restart-config-diagnosis"}}